MODULE: ReadyHistoryWinnersOnly
TARGET: HistoryExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: History applies current-winner selection and silently loses low-clock committed revisions
PERTURBS: HistoryPublish

--- FIND
    /\ history' = [history EXCEPT ![c] = @ \cup {<<t,k>> : k \in TxKeys(t)}]
--- REPLACE
    /\ history' = [history EXCEPT ![c] = @ \cup {<<t,t>>}]
--- END
